    "title": "Pearland crushes Alvin 59-7 to remain unbeaten - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lloyd Hendricks ,\n12 hours ago The Pearland Oilers continued their march through the 2026 football season Friday night, turning in another dominant performance with a 59-7 victory over the Alvin Yellowjackets. Pearland showed no signs of slowing down as the Oilers overwhelmed Alvin on both sides of the ball and improved to 7-0. The 59 points marked a season high for Pearland, which has now outscored its first seven opponents by a combined 333-69. The Oilers finished with 505 yards of total offense, including 207 through the air, and scored eight touchdowns in the lopsided victory. Read full article\n1",
